    "ACTIVED_EQUIP_BY_SLOT mirrors Sources/Core/Src/KItemList.cpp:41-58 ms_ActivedEquip; every EquipmentSlot must be keyed so calculateEquipEnhance never dereferences a missing adjacency.",
    "hiddenMagicActivation.rows asserts every (slot, neighbour) accrue path can fire on at least one seed item: there exists a seed item allowed in `slot` with series sI and a seed item allowed in `neighbour` with series sN where SERIES_ACCRUE_TARGET[sN] === sI. Self-references like horse->horse mirror PC `KItemList.cpp:54` (no adjacency) and are excluded from failure."
